    "description": "We at SRL Diagnostics Global Group are looking for an experienced Senior Doctor based out of Gwalior. If you are a result-oriented professional with a passion for excellence, we want to hear from you.\n\nAbout SRL Diagnostics Global Group:\nSRL Diagnostics Global Group is a leading organization in the On-site sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Maintain sterile environments and follow infection control protocols\n• Coordinate with multidisciplinary teams for comprehensive patient management\n• Adhere to NABH/JCI accreditation standards\n• Respond to medical emergencies and provide immediate care\n• Diagnose and treat medical conditions following established protocols\n• Educate patients and families on health management and disease prevention\n• Administer medications and treatments as prescribed\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• B.Com / M.Com / MBA Finance\n• 1-3 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Patient Care\n• Proficiency in Surgical Procedures\n• Proficiency in Medical Ethics\n• Proficiency in HIPAA Compliance\n• Proficiency in Diagnostic Skills\n• Proficiency in Clinical Documentation\n• Proficiency in Medical Terminology\n• Proficiency in EMR/EHR\n\nWork Mode: On-site - Work from our office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Company-sponsored certifications\n• Flexible working hours\n• Provident Fund and Gratuity as per company policy\n• Comprehensive health insurance for self and family\n• Meal coupons and food allowance\n• Transportation and conveyance allowance\n• Salary Range: 4 LPA - 9 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Gwalior, Madhya Pradesh, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with SRL Diagnostics Global Group!",
